  highlights:['Function identified: compressor/limiter (README said unknown)','Functional and full schematics redrawn from the R12 DWGs','A tone burst through compressor and limiter, envelope by envelope','Board drawn from the M8207 Tango placement','Shares PCB 14-278 with the M8208'],
